              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basebethatha imfuyo yabo; amakamela abo abe yimihlambi eyizinkulungwane ezingamashumi ayisihlanu namakhulu amabili namashumi ayisihlanu, nezimbongolo eziyizinkulungwane ezimbili, namadoda ayizinkulungwane eziyikhulu.",
