              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantwana benxenye yesizwe sakwaManase bahlala ezweni; banda kusukela eBashani kuze kufike eBali Hermoni naseSeniri naseNtabeni iHermoni.",
