              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laba babeyizinhloko zezindlu zawoyise: u-Eferi, no-Ishi, no-Eliyeli, no-Asiriyeli, noJeremiya, noHodawa, noJagidiyeli, amaqhawe anamandla, amadoda adumileyo nezinhloko zezindlu zawoyise.",
