        {
          "text": "UNkulunkulu ka-Israyeli wawuvusa umoya kaPhuli inkosi yase-Asiriya nomoya kaThiligati Philineseri inkosi yase-Asiriya, wabahola, abakwaRubeni nabakwaGadi nengxenye yesizwe sakwaManase, wabayisa eHala, naseHabori, naseHara, nasemfuleni iGoshani, kuze kube namuhla.",
